GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?category=就職活動

### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ハリーポッター",
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 3. 1件更新する
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Javaの基礎と練習問題に取り組む",
  "detail": null,
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-31",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/24
### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/25
### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/26


### 5. 祝日を直接取ってくる
GET https://holidays-jp.github.io/api/v1/date.json

### 6. 自分のアプリの祝日API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/holidays

### 7. 期間指定で取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?from=2026-04-01&to=2026-04-30

### 8. 就職活動に向けて履歴書を準備する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "応募先に提出する履歴書を仕上げる",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-22"
}

### 9. 技術面接に向けて課題を練習する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "技術面接に向けてJavaの課題を練習する",
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-22"
}

### 10. 応募先で役立つ資格の学習計画を立てる
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "応募先で役立つ資格の学習計画を立てる",
  "category": "資格",
  "priority": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-22"
}

### 11. MCP API
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp

### 12. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "requests.http", "version": "1.0" }
  }
}

### 13. 道具の一覧をもらう
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id:9a504eeb-bdb8-4194-8a7b-74e4817aefe2

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list", "params": {} }

### 14. 道具を1つ呼んでみる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id:9a504eeb-bdb8-4194-8a7b-74e4817aefe2

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call",
  "params": { "name": "list_todos", "arguments": {} } }